      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The increased span of life is resulting in larger and larger numbers of our population to be included among our aged. The City has and must assume its responsibility to provide services, wherever needed, to our older citizens to assure them security, comfort, happiness and personal dignity in their declining years.",
