    {
      "bbox": [
        457,
        1748,
        1619,
        2022
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "This administration stands ready to provide and increase its services to its aged citizens. On October 28, 1960, I issued a statement, at the first meeting of the Citizens Committee on Aging of the Community Council of Greater New York, on the City's positive program and responsibilities for providing these services to be rendered to the aged.",
